<human_speech><green>Second lineage. It was bred against the first one, as well as the catalogue.<\green><blue>So it has seen an opponent that expands fast and garrisons thin, and learned to punish that.<\blue><green>Which is what you did last time. Correct that.<\green><blue>Note the difference in how it opens, <\blue><golden><shining>Blotto<\golden><\shining><blue>. We will ask you about it.<\blue><\human_speech>
